==Battleground==
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 80~100 seconds<sup>2,400f~3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Bore]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
3-4 Meatshields, including [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] to counter ChickFul A, a few ranged units ([[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] with both their variants, etc.), [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]], [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Magica Cat]] (True Forms recommended) to deal with the Bores, [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] if you have him to [[Freeze]] the Bun Bun Black, otherwise use 4 meatshields and ranged units to kill him. You've dealt with much stronger Bun Bun Blacks in [[Underground]] and [[Satan's Bedroom]], and a much stronger Bore also present in Satan's Bedroom, so as long as you can handle the Chickful A's, this stage shouldn't be too hard.

